# Food AI Segmentation and Nutrition Estimation

This project uses deep learning to segment food from an image and estimate basic nutrition information. The model is trained using food image segmentation datasets and predicts a mask that separates the food region from the background.

## Dataset Download

Download the datasets from here:

FoodSeg103:  
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ggrill/foodseg103

UEC-FoodPix Complete:  
https://mm.cs.uec.ac.jp/uecfoodpix/

After downloading the datasets, place them inside the project folder like this:

